      "content": "Frappe framework generates REST API for all of your DocTypes out of the box. You can also run arbitrary python methods using their dotted module path.\n\n### Create\n\nCreate a new document by sending a POST request to /api/resource/:doctype. Send the document as JSON in the Request Body.\nPOST /api/resource/:doctype # Body {\"description\": \"New ToDo\"}\nResponse\n{ \"data\": { \"name\": \"af2e2d0e33\", \"owner\": \"Administrator\", \"creation\": \"2019-06-03 14:19:00.281026\", \"modified\": \"2019-06-03 14:19:00.281026\", \"modified_by\": \"Administrator\", \"idx\": 0, \"docstatus\": 0, \"status\": \"Open\", \"priority\": \"Medium\", \"description\": \"New ToDo\", \"doctype\": \"ToDo\" } }",
